## Verification boundaries

<ul><% audit['limitations'].each do |limitation| %><li><%= escape(limitation) %></li><% end %></ul>

The remedies update documentation, examples, shared presentation and the maintained lighting-card request/count behaviour. The 30 Home Assistant guides specify native tasks; they do not replace native editors or add unsupported device capabilities. Physical device outcomes and complete native assistive-technology coverage need their own installation-specific evidence.
